{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00586",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.49,
      "end_seconds": 9.94,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "Good morning, Doctor. Thank you for seeing me. I'm afraid it's rather a small thing, these warts on my hands."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.81,
      "end_seconds": 14.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Not at all. Tell me about them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.55,
      "end_seconds": 25.79,
      "duration_seconds": 9.24,
      "text": "Well, the first one appeared on my right thumb, and now there are a few more along my fingers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.02,
      "end_seconds": 38.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Which hand has most of them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.02,
      "end_seconds": 47.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "Mainly the right, though two have crept onto the left, I'm sorry to say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.04,
      "end_seconds": 60.4,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "Mm-hm. And when did you first notice the one on your thumb?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.44,
      "end_seconds": 70.84,
      "duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "text": "About four months ago, I'd say. I thought it was a bit of hard skin at first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.8,
      "end_seconds": 76.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "And how have they changed since then?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.55,
      "end_seconds": 84.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "They've multiplied. There were two, and now I count seven or eight."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.75,
      "end_seconds": 97.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "What does it feel like, having them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.94,
      "end_seconds": 108.02,
      "duration_seconds": 9.08,
      "text": "Rough, mostly. They catch on the wool of my gloves, and that's a nuisance."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.79,
      "end_seconds": 112.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Do they itch or hurt at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.97,
      "end_seconds": 123.54,
      "duration_seconds": 8.57,
      "text": "No, neither of those. They just look dreadful. My granddaughter won't hold my hand!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.94,
      "end_seconds": 138.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Ah, now. What's been bothering you most about them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.73,
      "end_seconds": 146.88,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "Honestly, the look of them, and I'd hate to pass them on to anyone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.57,
      "end_seconds": 157.51,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "text": "That's a very reasonable thing to think about. Do you have any idea where they came from?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.89,
      "end_seconds": 167.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.81,
      "text": "A neighbour's lad had them last summer, but I wouldn't like to blame him."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.76,
      "end_seconds": 177.65,
      "duration_seconds": 8.89,
      "text": "Nobody can ever say for sure where they come from, so don't be blaming yourself either."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.21,
      "end_seconds": 186.82,
      "duration_seconds": 7.61,
      "text": "I see. Well, I'd just like to know whether there's anything to be done."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.0,
      "end_seconds": 198.74,
      "duration_seconds": 10.74,
      "text": "There are a few options, and we'll go through them. First, would you hold your hands out under the light for me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.6,
      "end_seconds": 203.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Of course. Is that all right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.34,
      "end_seconds": 222.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Grand, thank you. I've seen what I need to see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.29,
      "end_seconds": 233.22,
      "duration_seconds": 9.93,
      "text": "While you're here, I'll check your blood pressure and pulse quickly. Pop your sleeve up for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.81,
      "end_seconds": 242.9,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "Certainly. I always get a bit nervous in these rooms, I must say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.16,
      "end_seconds": 261.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "Very common. Blood pressure is 142 over 86, and your pulse is 78."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.26,
      "end_seconds": 266.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Is that all right, so?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.43,
      "end_seconds": 280.98,
      "duration_seconds": 12.55,
      "text": "That's grand, thanks. Now, about the warts themselves. Many of them clear up on their own, though it can take months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.18,
      "end_seconds": 289.22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "text": "Months? I had hoped for something a bit quicker."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.22,
      "end_seconds": 301.92,
      "duration_seconds": 10.7,
      "text": "I understand. For now, the best thing is not to pick or scratch at them, because that can spread them about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.04,
      "end_seconds": 306.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Right. I'll leave them be, so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.46,
      "end_seconds": 315.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "Wash your hands after touching them, and don't share towels with anyone at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.52,
      "end_seconds": 324.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "text": "Towels, yes. I'll tell my husband, he's dreadful for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.95,
      "end_seconds": 333.45,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "If they catch on your gloves, a plaster over the worst one is perfectly fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.63,
      "end_seconds": 340.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "That's a good idea. I hadn't thought of that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.53,
      "end_seconds": 347.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "And waiting it out is a perfectly good plan, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 348.53,
      "end_seconds": 352.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "What happens if they don't go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.36,
      "end_seconds": 368.12,
      "duration_seconds": 14.76,
      "text": "Then we'll look again. If they haven't cleared up in three months, come back and see me, and we'll talk about what else can be done."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.67,
      "end_seconds": 377.83,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "Three months. That seems fair. And if they start spreading quickly before then?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.39,
      "end_seconds": 386.39,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "Then don't wait that long. Ring the surgery and book in sooner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.78,
      "end_seconds": 392.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "I will. Thank you ever so much, Doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 393.14,
      "end_seconds": 398.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "You're very welcome. Mind how you go on the steps."
    }
  ]
}
